# The build context of every web image (web/Dockerfile, apps/render-worker/Dockerfile): sources
# only. Installed and built output is made inside the image; secrets never enter it.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.log*
